await page.locator('main select').first().selectOption({ label: 'Activos' });
await page.waitForTimeout(2000);
await expect(page.getByText(code).first()).toBeVisible();
```
That's correct.

So PASO-3.01's logic is wrong: it selects 'archived' right after archiving and expects count 0. Let me fix PASO-3.01 to follow the correct sequence:

